<H1>Medium data</H1>
Search for medium no. = [413].
<HR>
Unless otherwise stated, sterilize media by autoclaving at 121&#176;C for 15 min.
<HR>
<P><B><FONT SIZE=3>413&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;MMJS MEDIUM</FONT></B></P>
Use Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=369">369</a> supplemented with 20.0 g/L (final) NaCl, 2.0 g/L (final) NaHCO<sub>3</sub> and 2.0 g/L Na<sub>2</sub>S<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub>&#183;5H<sub>2</sub>O.  Replace the gas phase with N<sub>2</sub>-CO<sub>2</sub>-O<sub>2</sub> (79:20:1, v/v), and pressurized inoculated bottles to 200 kPa with the same gas mixture.       <br>
